                                                "sense_id": "c4e5f3f9-fceb-3c7a-8cd9-128019be4df2",
                                                "text": "Some of the Umayyads found themselves charmed by the cultures which they had conquered, so that archaeologists in Palestine and Syria have revealed an astonishing flourishing of Christian-style figural art under their rule."
